WEBVTT

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.990
I saw the plate number on the car.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.960
Where are your parents?

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.060
They're gonna be late again tonight.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:45.570
Ryo-kun...

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.250
Niichan!

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.320
This... is the twilled Sea of Psyche.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.370
And the calm nearby.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:34.120
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:40.110
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.590
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:47.960
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:52.270
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:55.800
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:59.510
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.680
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.210
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:09.050
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.990
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:19.830
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:25.770
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:37.280
kasaneta inochi ga
yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:41.080
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:46.890
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:54.420
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.970
What we aimed to do was terminate
the subspecies of Persona.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.990
The genuine Personas have their roles and means.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.720
When the time comes, you'll-

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:29.560
Blend with the sea of unconsciousness and
eventually reincarnate as a brand new Persona.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.530
I'm going to sever that chain.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:33.520
Kanzato...

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:37.410
Not only the ones forced to unite,

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:42.500
but our Personas should've
never been exposed, either.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.040
Some dangers can only be
prevented with Personas!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:51.510
Humans should never be able to
use such things as tools of war.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.510
Personas are the distortion.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:56.220
The love of your life...

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.890
Why do you think she was
able to reach that snowfield?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:05.360
Even if it never appears, it makes miracles happen.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.600
Personas represent our desires, after all.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.900
You're not one to misunderstand that.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.240
If only they didn't exist...

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.180
It's impossible, Kanzato.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.050
I'll end this.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.380
This time around...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.540
I will definitely...

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.860
So you wish to extinguish all Personas?

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:58.980
It hurts...

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.550
This is horrible... It hurts...

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.830
Did you say something?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:17.700
Narasaki?

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.640
I'm... sorry...

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.410
You're awake.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.210
For not being able to protect Yuuna.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.580
I'm so glad to see you doing well.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.680
Mieko? Is that you?

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.130
I see...

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:49.290
Does this mean
the Whale's condition is worsening?

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:56.310
The Complex Persona shell collected from
Kujo's facility might be making its move.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.910
You guys must not take any action.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.110
But...

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.240
You all did enough.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.790
Let me see my brother. Jun and Yuki, too.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.780
You will. Once again.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:13.620
Why did you tell me to avoid your other self?

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.920
Your father wanted to cut you off from the Whale.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.200
You, too.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:21.970
I just want to unite with the Whale and sleep.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:26.240
For an existence between the
gap to unite, it needs a shell.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.570
So I waited...

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.940
I don't want any Personas.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.150
That's why I separated those two.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.940
Ryo hates Personas, too.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.750
But he reunited them again.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.480
Aniki...

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.950
What about Jun?
What happened to Jun and Yuki?

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.360
Why did you take them away?

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:54.370
Where are they?

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:58.630
They're sleeping in a dream which led you here.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.010
A dream...

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:04.000
The "time" was supposed to just be temporary.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.940
Without Personas,
what you forgot will become a lie.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.380
And that dream will become your truth.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.850
All of your truths.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.530
It's the opposite of the picture book's ending.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.960
Everyone was there...

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.170
Aniki, I...

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.940
You have to stay here.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.900
Casualties are inevitable right now.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.900
It's heading to Toyama Bay.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.810
We will ignite the explosive
once it's by the shoreline.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.350
Understood.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.310
Please let me know when it's time.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.810
Ayane!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.910
The me created by my dad.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.360
Let's go to the Whale together.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.930
Inui, set it off!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:32.830
But...

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.390
Doesn't matter! Hurry!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.290
I have to stop this...

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:35.190
Can't you come back?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.230
Let's go back, aniki! Jun and Yuki, too!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.330
Jun and Yuki are coming with me.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:48.480
Why?

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.140
Where to?

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:51.010
Aniki!

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.000
Shin, stay here.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:00.710
Thanks, aniki.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.220
For all this time.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.520
For such a long time.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.890
For protecting me, even from far away.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.890
And continuing to protect me.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.000
But...

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.670
You have to stop this.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:11.290
Takuro!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.950
You're being reckless!

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.620
How much of a man can you be!?

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.130
But...

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.140
Takuro... Kayano...

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.500
Hell, I'll turn inside-out!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.730
Takuro...

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:33.030
Ayane... Get Kanzato Shin's Persona.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.970
Let's unite with the Whale, Dad.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.970
Aniki...

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.010
Outta the way!

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.770
It's finally going to end...

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:10.970
Don't let her go!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:14.340
If she comes in contact with the
Whale... It'll be like that day!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.440
It won't happen again.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:21.920
The distorted Personas...
our Personas, too, will be abolished.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.180
Aniki...

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:37.910
Shin...

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:42.600
Cut off your Persona and leave this battle.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.370
That sword was once used as a wedge.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.140
It was created by two whose
souls were burdened with guilt.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.150
The sword is used to release
people from their Personas.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:55.850
Aniki!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.540
So it was you.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.340
You created that girl and made her
into an existence between the gap.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:19.010
You engraved our parents'
guilt deep in Shin's psyche.

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:23.080
Sure enough, saving Yuki...

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.180
saving both of them was possible.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.690
It wasn't impossible.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:34.460
But if I weren't there, you would've
ended up waiting for both their deaths.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.550
If only you weren't...

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.680
It's all... because of the Personas...

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.080
But, no...

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:03.290
Shin-oniichan...

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.000
Ryo-oniichan already knows...

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:16.830
What the Whale is resisting are the souls of
Personas, toyed with and distorted by humans.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.100
Also, the raging Sea of Psyche.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:24.810
So, Ryo-niichan is trying to calm the Whale.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:29.450
We two are the heaviest cross Ryo-niichan bears.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:32.210
We've decided to fall asleep together.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.950
It was fun getting to
spend time in this town again.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.630
Even when all the thoughts came pouring in,

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:46.530
it didn't pain you or your friends in this town.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.170
Everyone, thank you.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.680
Don't!

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:03.620
Jun! Yuki! Don't go!

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.390
I won't let you!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.320
D-don't go... Jun...

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:51.020
Let's go back... Ryo-niichan...

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.510
Ryo...niichan...

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.540
Aniki.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.770
How's packing?

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.940
I'm done with it.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.000
I shipped everything I needed already.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.940
I'm glad Kayano was over there.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:18.250
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.920
Aren't you glad it was only
a year you missed school?

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:22.180
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.020
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?
Yeah.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:23.420
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:25.690
Your college is near Megumi-san, right?

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:26.190
When did I start pretending
