00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:28.290
Takuro-san was jealous.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:28.920
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:29.590
Oh yeah, make sure you don't trouble him at work.

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:32.090
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.390
It's an important time for him,
since he just became manager.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:37.300
Don't worry. I'm better at
helping the customers than he is.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:41.130
With no courage to open a small
