00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:46.140
I can't cover up the loneliness, but
some of the burden can be shared

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.080
You have the spare key, right?

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:48.280
I can't cover up the loneliness, but
