00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:18.840
So when you're lost, remember
the sky you saw that day

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:24.480
The answer you were looking for

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:31.540
is at the place you dreamed of

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:48.900
After wiping away the tears

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:54.880
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:58.710
Even if I lose everything

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:04.890
There are still some things to discover

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:10.290
